'''Paldean Tauros''' (Japanese: '''パルデアケンタロス''' ''Paldean Kentauros'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

