==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the Blaze Breed [[Paldean form]] of {{p|Tauros}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Paldean Tauros|28}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*{{m|Take Down}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Paldean Tauros can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

